{
  "id": "70",
  "title": "五行生剋赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“五行生剋赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大哉干支，生物之始，本乎天地，万象宗焉。有阴阳变化之机，时候浅深之用；故，金木水火土无正形，生剋制化理取不一。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-c625d26a334d045e4988-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "假如死木，偏宜活水长濡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-784e807ae2a633983a15-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "譬若顽金，最喜红炉煆炼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-7b392cf23202ac4694f6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "太阳火忌林木为讎。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-0f0a0db6e2a79075a655-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "栋樑材求斧斤为友。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-fe94340b6707b67241f7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火隔水，不能鎔金。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-c8677568962586739a79-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金沉水，岂能剋木。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-3415cb0336a9ca4c7ac9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "活木忌埋根之铁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-b9e518dec128b2765103-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "死金嫌盖顶之泥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-8f8106a87b48542c2034-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙欲成一块，须加穿凿之功。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-6e2d6e8be2d6d0bab457-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬癸能达五湖，盖有併流之性。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-d93d564d6e896359f31d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "樗木不禁利斧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-9af366ff1ab79e1926c9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "真珠最怕明炉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-031002b8508244623fc6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "弱柳乔松，时分衰旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-f14cffd9c3c7858c4732-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "寸金尺铁，气用刚柔。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-467939b7fc2847815a02-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "陇头之土，少木难疏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-bbd0b5bfc6c67b6abb94-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "炉内之金，湿泥反蔽。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-4022624a2f14e1e2368e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "雨露安滋朽木。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-022b59a92bef4a01cbb7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "城墙不产真金。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-5a9efc84c3d8ef7dd445-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "剑戟成功，遇火乡而反坏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-35a5fa39922f4d5309af-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "城墙积就，至木地而愁伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-6acb89d95d1c944f028c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸丙春生，不雨不晴之象。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-2c1d8558d0acb3b13e20-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙丁冬产，非寒非煖之天。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-0b5ef33ae1b1eb47e7b2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "极锋抱水之金，最钝离炉之铁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-c73645746acfadd169b7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙遇金强，魂归西兑（酉）。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-b02edb7b6ba6203c645d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛逢火旺，气散南离（午）。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-91fb41e314f67dfa3f99-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土燥火炎，金无所赖。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-9f377e5649acdcfba2d3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木浮水泛，火不能生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-3ad85c59cb53b5aa31e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三夏鎔金，安制坚刚之木。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-00d57ca42bb85d377144-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三冬湿土，难隄泛滥之波。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-b4f9453f96a3ef432d7a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "轻尘撮土，终非活木之基。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-be3f85777e42bf168be9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "废铁销金，岂是滋流之本。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-11eb05c9bf7129e9c648-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木盛，能令金自缺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-cbf430c0114f89bd65c0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土虚，反被水相欺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-5e74b8fffd17742ece72-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火无木，则终其光。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-7fe262b003cd9e01dde7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木无火，则晦其质。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-5324065a568c743b64a6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙木秋生，拉朽摧枯之易也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-c1df42967fd745128b1a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚金冬死，沉沙坠海岂难乎！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-d10d094228ff7894914f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凝霜之草，奚用逢金。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-50d3d28f5a9893977343-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "出土之金，不能胜木。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-a7d1f6d65af9b8c44246-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火未焰，而先烟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-c0fdcccfd78f9cdfa46a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水既往，而犹湿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-90ad013fb2da5cfc8acc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大抵，水寒不流，木寒不发，土寒不生，火寒不烈，金寒不鎔；皆非天地之正气也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-237156cd46972305f26c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "然，万物初生未成，而成久则灭。其超凡入圣之机，脱死回生之妙；不象而成，不形而化，固用不如固本，花繁岂若根深。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-09942e00fa38ae281365-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "且如，北金恋水而沉形（水多金沉）；南木飞灰而脱体（火旺木焚）；东水旺木以枯源（木盛水缩）；西土实金而虚己（金多土变）；火因土晦皆太过（土多火埋）。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-8bd6ecbc7ee1d54848d1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行贵在中和。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-8e2d7fb89a355c587ffe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以理求之，慎勿茍言，掬尽寒潭须见底。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "70-0fd7c475f73c369fdec3-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
